{
  "title": "The All-Inclusive Supplication (Ya Man Azhar al-Jamil)",
  "data": "This supplicatory prayer wards off sin and brings about all one's requests of this world and the Hereafter:\nبِسْمِ اللّٰهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْمِ\nBISMILLAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEM\nIn the Name of Allah, the Beneficent, the Merciful.\nيَا مَنْ اَظْهَرَ الْجَمِيْلَ وَسَتَرَ الْقَبِيْحَ وَلَمْ يَهْتِكِ السِّتْرَ عَنِّىْ\nYAA MAN AZHARAL JAMEELA WA SATARAL QABEEHA WA LAM YAHTIKIS SITRA A'NNEE\nO He Who has made the beautiful manifest and concealed the ugly, and has not torn away the veil from me!\nيَا كَرِيْمَ الْعَفْوِ يَا حَسَنَ التَّجَاوُزِ يَا وَاسِعَ الْمَغْفِرَةِ وَيَا بَاسِطَ الْيَدَيْنِ بِالرَّحْمَةِ\nYAA KAREEMAL A'FWI YAA HASANAT TAJAAWUZI YAA WAASI'AL MAGHFIRATI WA YAA BAASITAL YADAYNI BIR RAHMAH\nO He Whose pardon is generous! O He Whose overlooking is excellent! O He Whose forgiveness is vast! O He Who stretches out both hands with mercy!\nيَا صَاحِبَ كُلِّ نَجْوٰى وَيَا مُنْتَهٰى كُلِّ شَكْوٰى\nYAA SAAHIBA KULLI NAJWAA WA YAA MUNTAHAA KULLI SHAKWAA\nO Companion of every secret prayer! O Final Recourse of every complaint!\nيَا كَرِيْمَ الصَّفْحِ يَا عَظِيْمَ الْمَنِّ يَا مُبْتَدِئَ كُلِّ نِعْمَةٍ قَبْلَ اسْتِحْقَاقِهَا\nYAA KAREEMAS SAFHI YAA A'ZEEMAL MANNI YAA MUBTADI'A KULLI NI'MATIN QABLAS TIHQAAQIHAA\nO He Who is generous in forgiving! O He Whose favor is immense! O Initiator of every blessing before it is deserved!\nيَا رَبَّاهُ يَا سَيِّدَاهُ يَا مَوْلَيَاهُ يَا غَايَتَاهُ يَا غِيَاثَاهُ\nYAA RABBAAHU YAA SAYYIDAAHU YAA MAWLAYAAHU YAA GHAAYATAAHU YAA GHIYAATHAAH\nO my Lord! O my Master! O my Patron! O my Ultimate Goal! O my Succor!\nصَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ وَاَسْئَلُكَ اَنْ لَا تَجْعَلَنِىْ فِى النَّارِ\nSALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALI MUHAMMADIN WA AS'ALUKA AN LAA TAJ'ALANEE FIN NAAR\nBless Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad, and I ask You not to put me in the Fire.\nImam al-Sadiq (a.s.) is reported to have said this supplicatory prayer:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اَنْتَ ثِقَتِىْ فِىْ كُلِّ كُرْبَةٍ وَاَنْتَ رَجَاۤئِىْ فِىْ كُلِّ شِدَّةٍ\nALLAAHUMMA ANTA THIQATEE FEE KULLI KURBATIN WA ANTA RAJAA'EE FEE KULLI SHIDDAH\nO Allah, You are my trust in every distress, and You are my hope in every hardship,\nوَاَنْتَ لِىْ فِىْ كُلِّ اَمْرٍ نَزَلَ بِىْ ثِقَةٌ وَعُدَّةٌ\nWA ANTA LEE FEE KULLI AMRIN NAZALA BEE THIQATUN WA U'DDAH\nand in every matter that befalls me, You are my trust and my provision.\nكَمْ مِنْ كَرْبٍ يَضْعُفُ عَنْهُ الْفُؤَادُ وَتَقِلُّ فِيْهِ الْحِيْلَةُ وَيَخْذُلُ عَنْهُ الْقَرِيْبُ وَالْبَعِيْدُ\nKAM MIN KARBIN YAD'UFU A'NHUL FU'AADU WA TAQILLU FEEHIL HEELATU WA YAKHDHULU A'NHUL QAREEBU WAL BA'EED\nHow many a distress, in which the heart grows weak and means grow few, in which the near and the far forsake one,\nوَيَشْمَتُ بِهِ الْعَدُوُّ وَتُعْيِيْنِىْ فِيْهِ الْاُمُوْرُ\nWA YASHMATU BIHIL A'DUWWU WA TU'YEENEE FEEHIL UMOOR\nover which the enemy gloats and in which all affairs leave me helpless,\nاَنْزَلْتُهٗ بِكَ وَشَكَوْتُهٗ اِلَيْكَ رَاغِبًا فِيْهِ عَمَّنْ سِوَاكَ\nANZALTUHOO BIKA WA SHAKAWTUHOO ILAYKA RAAGHIBAN FEEHI A'MMAN SIWAAK\nhave I brought before You and complained of to You, turning to You in it rather than to anyone else,\nفَفَرَّجْتَهٗ وَكَشَفْتَهٗ وَكَفَيْتَنِيْهِ\nFAFARRAJTAHOO WA KASHAFTAHOO WA KAFAYTANEEH\nand You relieved it, removed it, and sufficed me against it!\nفَاَنْتَ وَلِىُّ كُلِّ نِعْمَةٍ وَصَاحِبُ كُلِّ حَاجَةٍ وَمُنْتَهٰى كُلِّ رَغْبَةٍ\nFA-ANTA WALIYYU KULLI NI'MATIN WA SAAHIBU KULLI HAAJATIN WA MUNTAHAA KULLI RAGHBAH\nSo You are the Master of every blessing, the Fulfiller of every need, and the Final End of every desire.\nفَلَكَ الْحَمْدُ كَثِيْرًا وَلَكَ الْمَنُّ فَاضِلًا\nFALAKAL HAMDU KATHEERAN WA LAKAL MANNU FAADILAA\nTo You belongs abundant praise, and to You belongs surpassing favor."
}
